{"id":"wb-5-45","name":"凌家滩遗址","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"凌家滩文化","text":"凌家滩文化为中国新石器文化之一，分布地点在长江中下游的巢湖地区， 凌家滩遗址位于安徽省含山县铜闸镇凌家滩村，地处裕溪河中段北岸，总面积约160万平方米，遗址约5000多年前为一处大型新石器时代晚期聚落。遗址区内发现有新石器时代晚期人工建造的祭坛、大型氏族墓地以及祭祀坑、红烧土和积石圈等重要遗迹，出土精美玉礼器、石器、陶器等珍贵文物。凌家滩文化被认为是中华五千年文明的重要源头之一。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%87%8C%E5%AE%B6%E6%BB%A9%E6%96%87%E5%8C%96","revisionId":92171313,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=92171313","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与所在地一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/d37237a17209927baf113e4a.jpg","title":"Lingjiatan Site, 2026-11-01 01.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Lingjiatan_Site,_2026-11-01_01.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/2a/Lingjiatan_Site%2C_2026-11-01_01.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Siyuwj","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​含山凌家滩遗址","width":320,"height":213,"matchEvidence":"维基共享资源名称与所在地一致"}}